      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok, i get the gist. but for my paper i need to be more specific about the actual evidence they point to. like, what are the specific scientific or statistical points they usually bring up to back up the idea that these IQ gaps are real and biological? like are there certain studies or specific concepts they rely on to make their case? i want to make sure i can represent their \"scientific\" reasoning accurately in my essay.",
